# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Committed build-time Supabase config for hosted (Lovable) PRODUCTION builds.
#
# These are PUBLIC values only — the project URL and the publishable/anon key.
# They are safe to commit: the anon key is designed to ship inside the browser
# bundle, and all access is enforced by Supabase Row-Level Security (RLS).
#
# The SECRET service-role key is intentionally NOT here and must never be
# committed. It is supplied by the server environment only (Lovable Cloud /
# server env), used exclusively by src/integrations/supabase/client.server.ts.
#
# Why this file exists: the hosted Lovable project has no Supabase env vars set,
# so the app threw "Missing Supabase environment variable(s)…". Vite loads this
# file during `vite build`, baking the values in. Local dev keeps using .env
# (gitignored). Any env vars Lovable sets itself take precedence over this file.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Browser (Vite build-time replacement)
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://iedumulghbzanxtwlmuu.supabase.co
VITE_SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=sb_publishable_Bt9dtVTaHvsqh_Nb1ctNSw_TZhZqtFN
VITE_SUPABASE_PROJECT_ID=iedumulghbzanxtwlmuu

# Server (SSR / process.env fallback)
SUPABASE_URL=https://iedumulghbzanxtwlmuu.supabase.co
SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=sb_publishable_Bt9dtVTaHvsqh_Nb1ctNSw_TZhZqtFN
SUPABASE_PROJECT_ID=iedumulghbzanxtwlmuu
